  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Intelligence-related slurs",
  "description": "The meme uses the text 'do you hate yourself?' and 'doubt science & established historical records?' to imply that the Black man is unintelligent or irrational, which is a direct reference to the anti-Black stereotype that Black people are less intelligent or incapable of understanding complex concepts like science or history. This stereotype is used to demean and dehumanize the individual based on his race.",
